%% 入库路径时序图：从 POST /v1/ingest 到 skill 可被推荐

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as 管理员/CLI
    participant API as Skillforge API
    participant Pipe as IngestPipeline
    participant Git as git clone
    participant Parser as frontmatter parser
    participant Emb as Embedder
    participant DB as SQLite + vss
    participant GH as GitHub REST API

    Admin->>API: POST /v1/ingest<br/>{github_url, branch}
    API->>Pipe: ingest(github_url, branch, session)
    activate Pipe

    Pipe->>DB: 同步：创建 IngestJob(status=pending)
    DB-->>Pipe: job_id
    Pipe->>API: 返回 IngestResponse
    Pipe-)Pipe: asyncio.create_task(run_job)<br/>持强引用避免 GC

    API-->>Admin: 202 + job_id

    Note over Pipe,DB: 以下在线程池异步进行

    Pipe->>DB: status: fetching
    Pipe->>Git: shallow clone (depth=1)
    Git-->>Pipe: temp dir
    Pipe->>GH: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}
    GH-->>Pipe: stars

    Pipe->>DB: status: parsing
    Pipe->>Parser: 递归扫描 **/SKILL.md
    Parser-->>Pipe: ParsedSkill[]

    Pipe->>DB: status: embedding
    Pipe->>Emb: embed_batch([name + description])
    Emb-->>Pipe: vectors

    loop 每个 ParsedSkill
        Pipe->>DB: upsert Skill(id=sha256[:16])
        Pipe->>DB: upsert_embedding(rowid, vec)
    end

    Pipe->>DB: status: done<br/>skills_added/updated counters

    Note over Pipe: 任何阶段异常 → status=error<br/>error 字段记 traceback
    deactivate Pipe

    Admin->>API: GET /v1/ingest/{job_id}
    API-->>Admin: status + counts
